          "You meet an unknown client with 401, a known one without permission with 403, already cancelled with 409, a DB outage with 5xx without masking it as 400, and you never hide an error in 200.",
          code="401 Unauthorized   — not authenticated\n403 Forbidden      — authenticated, no right\n409 Conflict       — already cancelled\n503 Service Unavailable — temporary outage",
